    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSpacious two bedroom first and second floor duplex apartment with parking in modern development in popular residential location close to a multitude of amenities.\n\nThe location of No. 3 Surehaven Lawn is highly convenient, enjoying ease of access to Castleknock village a number of popular amenities, including shopping facilities, restaurants and bars. The Phoenix Park and Blanchardstown Shopping Centre are all within easy access and there are a range of convenience stores and eateries within the immediate development. Convenient also to employment hubs as well as sport and leisure facilities. Right beside the magnificent Phoenix Park.\n\nNo. 3 extends to 84.4 sq.m (908 sq.ft) comprises of a downstairs hallway, bathroom and open plan kitchen, living and dining room. Upstairs includes two double bedrooms, one with an ensuite.\n\nSurehaven Lawn apartments and grounds are well designed and finished with excellent hard and soft landscaping incorporating many mature trees throughout an elegant setting that links directly to the 1,760 acres of public parklands at the Phoenix Park. Supporting facilities onsite include: parks, shops, café, salon, piazzas, court-yards, off street car and bicycle parking. All within easy access to the village of Castleknock with excellent bus and rail transport links to Dublin City Centre.\n\nThe Phoenix Park Racecourse enjoys a unique strategic location, close to both the city centre and the M50 Ring Road making it a perfect location for getting around Dublin City by public or private transport.\n\nCastleknock Village and The Phoenix Park provide some of the city's finest amenities in this highly sought after residential location. The Phoenix Park Racecourse offers an amenity rich lifestyle at an advantageous location, with a Neighbourhood Centre on site, anchored by Londis food hall. Comprising of a 500 sq.m premises which provides residents with a convenient retail amenity including: off-licence, deli and hot food. There is also the Phoenix Park Pharmacy, Nazoo Skin & Beauty who specialise in delivering high quality skincare and beauty services, KB Coffee Shop and the Hair Room. Phoenix Childcare Creche also opened this year which further enhances the offerings available to local residents."
      },
